# Private session artefacts (CDI-safety: do not expose employer/maintainer identity)
# .claude/STATE.md = the single live session-state source of truth (methodology v2).
# Gitignored on purpose: the IN-FLIGHT claim ledger mutates on every parallel session,
# so tracking it would mean constant merge conflicts (same class as GeneratedDemos.kt
# / llms-txt.ts). The durable cross-host shadow is the GitHub `in-progress` label.
.claude/STATE.md
# .claude/data/ = local runtime evidence for the Evidence-Stamped Claim Gate (#2346):
# last-store-probe.json (the /store-status live-probe record) + claim-ledger.tsv (the
# /caught miss ledger). Same policy as STATE.md — same-host, mutates constantly, never
# committed; claim-gate.sh reads it on the git-push hook to block unevidenced claims.
.claude/data/
.claude/handoff*.md
.claude/handoff-archive/
.claude/SESSION_*.md
.claude/SESSION-*.md
.claude/NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT.md
.claude/NOTICE-*.md
.claude/active-branches.md
.claude/audit-*.md
.claude/pixel9-*.md
.claude/website-review-*.md
.claude/launch.json
.claude/plans/
.claude/marketplace-submissions/
.claude/reports/
RERUN-CHECK.md

