# AR test fixtures — actual MP4 recordings stay LOCAL only.
# Public fixtures must be vetted for PII (camera frames) before commit.
# Treat each MP4 like the device screenshots from the 2026-05-07 incident:
# fully audit content before promoting to a tracked file.
samples/android-demo/src/androidTest/assets/ar-recordings/*.mp4
samples/screenshots/qa_log*.txt

